  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "綜合專題研究",
    "sub_ename": "SYNTHETICAL TOPICS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在使大四同學能利用先前所學的知識與分析工具進行特定主題的經濟問題研究。本課程進珍採分組團體研究方式，每組將由學生委請一位指導老師擔任指導教授指導，以協助學生完成較有品質的論文，論文必須在時限內完成，並公開發表，最後，經修改完成一份正式的專題報告，做為學習成果的展現。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is designed for the senior students to learn how to utilize the knowledge and the analytical tools they have been taught in conducting a research on a specific topic in economic issues. The course is in a form of group study, and each group has to ask a teacher to serve as thesis advisors.  The presence of a thesis advisor can help students write a quality thesis paper.  Each group has to present the paper openly in a seminar, and to polish and accomplish it before the deadline.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
